WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.471 --> 00:00:07.841
&gt;&gt; Bill: WE’VE BEEN WAITING FOR

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:08.875
&gt;&gt; Bill: WE’VE BEEN WAITING FOR

00:00:08.876 --> 00:00:09.199
THIS.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.178
MIGRANT ENCOUNTERS AT THE

00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:11.044
SOUTHERN BORDER DURING THE

00:00:11.055 --> 00:00:11.924
MONTH OF DECEMBER.

00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:13.850
IT SHOWS THE NUMBER TRYING TO

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:18.387
ENTER THE U.S. LAST MONTH

00:00:18.398 --> 00:00:21.075
HIGHER THAN THE THREE PREVIOUS

00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:22.394
DECEMBERS COMBINED.

00:00:22.428 --> 00:00:24.558
WE’RE ON THE STORY LIVE IN

00:00:24.569 --> 00:00:25.115
BROWNSVILLE, TEXAS.

00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:26.027
BILL, GOOD MORNING.

00:00:26.028 --> 00:00:27.695
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:29.537
RIGHT NOW WE’RE IN FRONT OF A

00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:30.743
PARKING GARAGE IN BROWNSVILLE

00:00:30.754 --> 00:00:33.036
WHERE FOR THE VERY FIRST TIME

00:00:33.047 --> 00:00:35.410
DURING THIS BORDER CRISIS WE

00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:36.822
ACTUALLY WITNESSED THE MASS

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.059
RELEASE SINGLE ADULT MALE

00:00:38.093 --> 00:00:39.281
MIGRANTS FROM FEDERAL CUSTODY.

00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:40.897
LOOK AT THE VIDEO WE SHOT HERE

00:00:40.931 --> 00:00:42.727
ON SUNDAY AFTERNOON.

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:44.707
WHAT YOU ARE LOOKING AT ARE

00:00:44.718 --> 00:00:45.633
FEDERALLY CONTRACTED BUSES

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:47.170
DROPPING OFF DOZENS OF MIGRANTS

00:00:47.204 --> 00:00:48.611
AT THE PARKING GARAGE.

00:00:48.622 --> 00:00:50.659
WHAT YOU NOTICE IS THESE ARE

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.572
ALL SINGLE ADULTS BEING

00:00:51.606 --> 00:00:52.209
RELEASED.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.744
ALMOST ALL OF THEM MEN, NO

00:00:54.745 --> 00:00:56.835
CHILDREN, NO FAMILY UNITS.

00:00:56.846 --> 00:00:59.812
THE RAISED EYEBROWS WITH US.

00:00:59.846 --> 00:01:01.814
SINGLE ADULTS ARE SUPPOSED TO

00:01:01.816 --> 00:01:06.260
BE EXPELLED FROM THE COUNTRY IN

00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:08.615
TITLE 42.

00:01:08.626 --> 00:01:12.177
WE WATCHED AS THEY WERE USHERED

00:01:12.211 --> 00:01:12.859
INSIGHT.

00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:14.965
AFTER A SHORT TIME IN THE

00:01:14.966 --> 00:01:17.881
OFFICE WE STARTED NOTICING TAXI

00:01:17.892 --> 00:01:19.810
CABS SHOWING UP TO THE PARKING

00:01:19.821 --> 00:01:20.247
GARAGE.

00:01:20.258 --> 00:01:23.170
MIGRANTS CAME OUT OF THE

00:01:23.205 --> 00:01:25.474
OFFICE, GOT INTO THE TAXI CABS

00:01:25.475 --> 00:01:29.318
AND THEY STARTED DRIVING AWAY.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.981
WE FOLLOWED THE TAXI CABS AND

00:01:31.992 --> 00:01:34.031
WENT TO AN AIRPORT AND THOSE

00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:35.430
MIGRANTS WERE DROPPED OFF AT

00:01:35.431 --> 00:01:36.508
THE AIRPORT TO FLY AROUND THE

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:36.847
COUNTRY.

00:01:36.858 --> 00:01:39.213
WE TALKED TO A COUPLE OF THEM

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.698
SAYING THEY WERE GOING TO

00:01:40.709 --> 00:01:42.306
ATLANTA, HOUSTON, MIAMI AND

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:44.121
JUST CROSSED ILLEGALLY AND PAID

00:01:44.132 --> 00:01:45.879
A CARTEL $2,000 TO DO SO.

00:01:45.913 --> 00:01:47.525
WE STOPPED IN BROWNSVILLE TO

00:01:47.536 --> 00:01:48.902
ASK WHAT’S GOING ON HERE AND

00:01:48.936 --> 00:01:49.790
CONFIRMED THEY’RE INVOLVED.

00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:51.301
THE STATEMENT IF THEY CAN PULL

00:01:51.302 --> 00:01:52.444
IT UP NOW.

00:01:52.455 --> 00:01:53.950
CITY OF BROWNSVILLE SAYING IN

00:01:53.984 --> 00:01:55.655
REFERENCE TO MIGRANTS IN

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:57.425
FEDERAL CUSTODY THE CITY OF

00:01:57.458 --> 00:01:58.677
BROWNSVILLE’S OFFICE OF

00:01:58.678 --> 00:01:59.883
EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT THROUGH

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:01.189
FEDERAL ASSISTANCE FROM FEMA

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.764
FACILITATES THE TRANSFER OF

00:02:02.775 --> 00:02:04.688
THESE MIGRANTS TO THEIR FINAL

00:02:04.699 --> 00:02:07.401
DESTINATION BY ALLOWING THEM TO

00:02:07.412 --> 00:02:09.239
USE SERVICES TO CONTACT

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.291
FAMILIES, NGOs OR TAXI CAB.

00:02:11.302 --> 00:02:12.851
IT IS A STAGING CENTER WHERE

00:02:12.885 --> 00:02:14.487
MIGRANTS COMING INTO THE

00:02:14.498 --> 00:02:15.752
COUNTRY ARE PROVIDED WITH

00:02:15.763 --> 00:02:16.868
TRAVEL INFORMATION TO

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.040
FACILITATE TRANSFER TO FINAL

00:02:18.075 --> 00:02:19.633
DESTINATION AND TOLD ME MEDIA

00:02:19.644 --> 00:02:21.538
IS NOT ALLOWED TO GO INSIDE AND

00:02:21.539 --> 00:02:22.317
SHOOT VIDEO.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.582
I REACHED OUT TO CBP TO ASK

00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:25.737
ABOUT THE RELEASE OF SINGLE

00:02:25.748 --> 00:02:26.405
ADULT MIGRANTS.

00:02:26.416 --> 00:02:27.759
THEY SAID THEY WEREN’T INVOLVED.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.742
I REACHED OUT TO ICE AND SAID

00:02:29.753 --> 00:02:31.230
THEY’RE LOOKING INTO IT.

00:02:31.264 --> 00:02:33.174
HOWEVER, A SOURCE WITHIN ICE

00:02:33.176 --> 00:02:34.532
TELLS ME THIS WAS AN ICE

00:02:34.543 --> 00:02:35.004
RELEASE.

00:02:35.038 --> 00:02:37.294
WE’LL SEND IT BACK TO YOU.

00:02:37.305 --> 00:02:37.558
&gt;&gt; Bill: AMAZING STUFF.

